WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 3dbda3c7a0cddd9de6e7b5c781e53bda

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:03.119
Habari, karibu kwenye Jiki. Jukwaa hili limegawanywa

00:00:03.159 --> 00:00:06.099
katika sehemu mbili: Jifunze Kupanga Programu na Jifunze

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:09.079
Kujenga. Katika Jifunze Kupanga Programu,

00:00:09.099 --> 00:00:11.460
utajifunza misingi ya kupanga programu na

00:00:11.519 --> 00:00:14.619
kupata picha ya jinsi msimbo unavyofanya kazi. Hata

00:00:14.639 --> 00:00:16.819
kama utaandika msimbo mchache kuliko

00:00:16.859 --> 00:00:19.479
ungeandika miaka kumi iliyopita, kujifunza misingi

00:00:19.539 --> 00:00:22.000
bado ni muhimu sana ili uweze kuelewa

00:00:22.039 --> 00:00:25.159
kinachoendelea. Katika Jifunze Kujenga, nitakuonyesha

00:00:25.299 --> 00:00:27.299
jinsi ya kutengeneza vitu halisi. Unaweza

00:00:27.359 --> 00:00:29.039
kuungana nami ninapotengeneza programu halisi

00:00:29.119 --> 00:00:31.859
na tovuti. Nitakuonyesha kila uamuzi

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.259
ninaofanya njiani na kueleza jinsi kila kitu

00:00:34.319 --> 00:00:38.220
kinavyofanya kazi. Sehemu hii inaanza tarehe 11

00:00:38.319 --> 00:00:40.319
Julai kwa kipindi cha moja kwa moja ambacho kila mtu

00:00:40.399 --> 00:00:43.360
anaweza kujiunga nacho. Unaweza kupitia sehemu zote mbili

00:00:43.459 --> 00:00:45.919
sambamba, ukitumia saa moja kwa siku kupanga programu

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:48.180
na kisha saa moja kujenga, na

00:00:48.219 --> 00:00:51.840
utapiga hatua haraka. Tumejenga Jiki tukiamini

00:00:51.899 --> 00:00:54.360
kwamba kujifunza kupanga programu kunapaswa kufurahisha,

00:00:54.419 --> 00:00:56.020
lakini pia kunapaswa kukupa changamoto,

00:00:56.059 --> 00:00:58.520
na kukusukuma mbele. Unapopitia

00:00:58.559 --> 00:01:01.599
jukwaa hili, chukua muda wako, kuwa na udadisi, na jaribu

00:01:01.639 --> 00:01:04.299
kufurahia safari. Ukikwama,

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:06.839
unaweza kushirikiana na msaidizi wetu wa AI

00:01:06.879 --> 00:01:08.759
akusaidie kusonga mbele, au unaweza kuwasiliana

00:01:08.779 --> 00:01:11.559
na jumuiya yetu. Na wanachama wa Premium wanaweza pia

00:01:11.599 --> 00:01:14.139
kuuliza maswali, nami nitayajibu kwenye

00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:16.639
vipindi vyetu vya kawaida vya moja kwa moja. Natumaini

00:01:16.659 --> 00:01:18.679
utafurahia sana kutumia Jiki, na kwamba kutakusaidia

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:21.039
kufungua ubunifu wako na kufikia malengo yako.
